# Quarto build artifacts and local execution caches
# Rendered site. Netlify publishes the committed _site, so every file Quarto
# renders is tracked and new pages need no rule of their own. Local downloads
# that are kept out of the public repository are listed here instead.
/_site/docs/
/_site/data/
/_site/BDC334/BDC334-Lecture-Transcripts.pdf
/_site/BDC334/resources/BDC334_Lab_2b_model_answers.R
/_site/_private/
# Animation production files copied with the media (the pages use only mp4, jpg, vtt, csv)
/_site/BDC223/animations/**/*.blend
/_site/BDC223/animations/**/*.ffmeta
/_site/BDC223/animations/**/*.json
/_site/BDC223/animations/**/*.md
/_site/BDC223/animations/**/*.py
/.quarto/
/site_libs/
/_freeze/site_libs/
**/*_files/
**/*_cache/
!_site/**/*_files/
!_site/**/*_files/**

